    ["<Assistant_Title1>【教团/跑团】</>\n<Assistant_System>教团</>是跑团体系中的核心成长与阵营系统。加入教团后，你可以获得独立的<Assistant_Property1>教团等级</>、<Assistant_Property1>教团属性</>和对应教团的专属玩法。\n\n<Assistant_Title2>主要内容：</>\n1. 选择教团并完成属性配置。\n2. 通过教团玩法获得教团行动值以及各类奖励。\n3. 提升教团等级，解锁动作、外观、称号等奖励。\n4. 在探索与教团玩法中使用魅力、直觉、学识、武力等属性进行判定。\n\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[如何加入教团]|1273}，{SendAnswer:[教团属性说明]|1275}，{SendAnswer:[教团行动值与周上限]|1276}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Coven/TRPG】</>\n<Assistant_System>Coven </> is the core growth and faction system in the TRPG system. After joining a Coven, you can obtain an independent <Assistant_Property1>Coven Level</>, <Assistant_Property1>Coven Attributes</>, and exclusive gameplay for that Coven. \n\n<Assistant_Title2>Main Content: </>\n1. Choose a Coven and complete attribute configuration. \n2. Obtain Coven Action Points and various rewards through Coven gameplay. \n3. Increase Coven Level to unlock rewards like actions, appearances, and titles. \n4. Use attributes like Charisma, Intuition, Knowledge, and Might for checks during exploration and Coven gameplay. \n\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[How to Join a Coven]|1273}, {SendAnswer:[Coven Attribute Explanation]|1275}, {SendAnswer:[Coven Action Points and Weekly Cap]|1276}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【诚颂】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>创角发型\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>创角后获得诚颂，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>创角时可选择获取一款发型，剩余发型后续可通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Sincere Praise】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Character creation hairstyle.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Obtain Sincere Praise after character creation. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Outfits</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Choose one hairstyle during character creation; remaining hairstyles can be obtained later via <Assistant_System>Shop</>.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>城堡-工坊</>\n<Assistant_Title2>基础介绍：</>\n1. 放置<Assistant_Property1>秘偶</>后，可选择并生产各种<Assistant_Property2>物产</>。\n2. 升级<Assistant_Property2>工坊</>后解锁更多物产。\n3. 工坊升级需要消耗<Assistant_Property2>城堡资产</>，同时升级受到城堡等级的限制。\n<Assistant_Title2>生产相关：</>\n1. <Assistant_Property1>上阵秘偶</>：工坊必须上阵秘偶，才能开始生产。\n2. <Assistant_Property2>稀有物产</>：制造物产时，有概率出现稀有物产（稀有物产的售价更高）。\n3. <Assistant_Property1>生产诀窍</>：查看他人城堡的高价回购清单，优先生产高价物产。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Castle-Workshop</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Basic Introduction: </>\n1. After placing a <Assistant_Property1>marionette</>, you can select and produce various <Assistant_Property2>products</>.\n2. Upgrade the <Assistant_Property2>Workshop</> to unlock more products.\n3. Upgrading the workshop consumes <Assistant_Property2>Castle Assets</> and is limited by the castle level.\n<Assistant_Title2>Production Details: </>\n1. <Assistant_Property1>Deploy Marionette</>: A marionette must be deployed in the workshop to begin production.\n2. <Assistant_Property2>Rare Products</>: There is a chance to produce rare products during manufacturing (rare products have a higher selling price).\n3. <Assistant_Property1>Production Tips</>: Check the high-price buyback lists of other castles and prioritize producing high-value products.",
